          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö ichihamatë chiyö nchasengeyë ÖMÖNENE, sibhoono guiki nchakoreeyë ëmërëmo ibhihooru bhiabho bhia gösasibhua na kuhika bhoono igo, abhaibhöroa bhaabho nkögenderria bharë gökora kehaara bhaaguuka bhaabho bhaakorrë.",
          "type": "text",
